[[0,858150,0,10,8,2,"2016-02-14T00:58:57","walkawaycreative","",[],"","Obama could nominate Jesus to replace Scalia & the GOP Senate would still block Him ","https://twitter.com/AlanDukeNews/status/698651055991574529","politics"],[1,4269667,0,10,0,10,"2016-02-14T01:03:59","NotWearingPants","",[],"<p>I don't think the guy who does my lawn is really qualified for the Supreme Court.</p>"],[2,4269852,4269667,4,0,4,"2016-02-14T01:20:41","bfriend13","",[],"<p>He would likely do better than whoever Obama picks.</p>"],[2,4270060,4269667,2,0,2,"2016-02-14T01:45:35","fricknmaniac","",[],"<p>Bush thought Harriet Miers was qualified, so I wouldn't put too much weight on Obama caring about that.</p>"],[1,4269687,0,2,2,0,"2016-02-14T01:05:50","ArchangelleShe","",[],"<p>Jesus was a socialist Jew, so yeah, he wasn't a very good Christian. </p>"],[1,4269705,0,1,0,1,"2016-02-14T01:07:25","Datawych","",[],"<p>Might have something to do with there being 6 other liberal justices.</p>"],[1,4269923,0,0,1,-1,"2016-02-14T01:27:47","Rottcodd","",[],"<p>'Course they would. Fucking commie'd wanna give free stuff to poor people, an' we ain't havin' any o' that commie bullshit in the good ol' USofA. </p>"],[1,4270082,0,0,0,0,"2016-02-14T01:48:20","kenlane","",[],"<p>Oddly enough, he'd be a great democratic candidate. If the Dems nominated a religious figure they would probably gain the religious vote and guarantee the general election. </p>"],[1,4270501,0,1,0,1,"2016-02-14T02:29:46","Onlio","",[],"<p>Obama will nominate Caitlin Jenner before Jesus</p>"],[1,4271030,0,0,0,0,"2016-02-14T03:27:23","TheRealVladimirPutin","",[],"<p>The nominee must be an actual, living person. </p>"]]
